# Auth stays mocked (the mock backend has no login/signup either) — don't
# turn this off, there's nothing real to fall back to.
VITE_USE_MOCKS=true
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# Where the Vite dev proxy forwards /api requests to (see vite.config.ts).
# Browser never sees this URL directly, so CORS doesn't apply.
# Points at backend/actual (Rooms/Users/Sensors, source of truth) on 8080.
# backend/mock (live sensor simulation, port 8081) is no longer the
# frontend's primary target — see HANDOFF_actual_backend_integration.md.
VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:8080
